$ story no-such-verb
exit: 2
stdout: <empty>
stderr: 
error: unknown command `no-such-verb`. Run `story --help` for usage.


$ story list --no-such-flag
exit: 2
stdout: <empty>
stderr: 
error: unknown flag `--no-such-flag` for `story list`.

`story list` takes: --state --assignee --priority --label --created-after --updated-after --stale --phase --type --flagged --blocked --ready --drafts --unassessed --include-closed --include-archived --all
If `--no-such-flag` was meant as text rather than a flag, quote it as one argument, or put it after a `--`.


